cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these materials, please cite them using the metadata below."
title: >-
  Certificate programs and Lean 4 formalization for "Rigidity of Fourier
  Multipliers for Universal Euler Convective Cancellations"
abstract: >-
  Exact-arithmetic certificate programs and a Lean 4 formalization accompanying
  the paper "Rigidity of Fourier Multipliers for Universal Euler Convective
  Cancellations". The programs certify the ranks of the finite seed matrices
  over the rationals using integer, exact rational, and modular arithmetic; no
  floating-point rank decision enters any certificate. The Lean development
  covers the main classification theorem and its solenoidal corollary and
  contains no admitted proofs.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Nogueira Pires"
    given-names: Rael
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: >-
  https://github.com/raelnogpires/rigidity-of-fourier-multipliers-for-universal-euler-convective-cancellations
identifiers:
