    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22819121
    description: Concept DOI, resolving to the most recent release.
keywords:
  - Euler equations
  - Fourier multipliers
  - rigidity
  - exact arithmetic certificates
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
  - energy and helicity
